1
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:26,930
♪ Street lights fade into the haze ♪

2
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:30,420
♪ We don't care what the world says ♪

3
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:34,210
♪ Quiet like a secret we keep ♪

4
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:37,720
♪ Close enough to feel your breathe ♪

5
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:41,220
♪ Rules are made to fall apart  ♪

6
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:45,150
♪ When you hold me in the dark ♪

7
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:48,640
♪ Every second feels so wrong ♪

8
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:52,510
♪ But it's where I belong ♪

9
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:56,500
♪ We shouldn't stay, but we don't leave ♪

10
00:00:56,530 --> 00:00:59,670
♪ This quiet chemistry ♪

11
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:03,150
♪ Soft and slow, we cross the line ♪

12
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,530
♪ Just one more time ♪

13
00:01:06,550 --> 00:01:10,600
♪ Slow embrace in the silent dark ♪

14
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:13,860
♪ Forbidden but it feels so right ♪

15
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,070
Not enough.

16
00:01:40,810 --> 00:01:41,530
Not enough?

17
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:44,590
This is already

18
00:01:44,979 --> 00:01:46,979
the most formal style in this store.

19
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:50,229
Not flashy enough.

20
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:57,170
You're going to a board meeting,

21
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:58,880
not walking the red carpet.

22
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,160
It's good enough.

23
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:03,370
The onboarding meeting
in front of those old guys

24
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:04,610
is my red carpet.

25
00:02:05,710 --> 00:02:07,240
I have to make them remember

26
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:09,900
that I am back.

27
00:02:11,250 --> 00:02:12,720
[Dearest: Episode 19]

28
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,400
In that case,

29
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,520
why not try this one?

30
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:27,790
Do you like it?

31
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,760
Yes, I do.

32
00:03:12,190 --> 00:03:13,710
The dress fits perfectly

33
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,870
and suits you well.

34
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,430
It's just that...

35
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:33,120
something is missing.

36
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:00,310
Add them,

37
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:05,150
and now it's perfect.

38
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:14,860
I'll take the dress.

39
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,630
Wrap it up.

40
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,920
Okay, Mrs. Yin.

41
00:04:18,269 --> 00:04:19,600
I'm sorry, Mrs. Wen.

42
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:21,160
She is

43
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:24,040
our top-tier VIP,

44
00:04:24,310 --> 00:04:26,720
so she has priority to purchase all items.

45
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:27,630
So...

46
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,190
So now,

47
00:04:30,450 --> 00:04:32,620
are you treating me as a fitting model?

48
00:04:34,930 --> 00:04:36,560
Doesn't it look pretty good?

49
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:48,480
Any clothes,

50
00:04:49,409 --> 00:04:51,290
as long as I wear them,

51
00:04:53,110 --> 00:04:55,920
only belong to me.

52
00:05:08,930 --> 00:05:10,790
Mrs. Yin, thank you for your help.

53
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:13,160
We are already engaged.

54
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:15,310
You are welcome to attend our wedding.

55
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:21,920
Mr. Jiang seems to have misunderstood,

56
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:25,800
or rather, is too narcissistic.

57
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,070
Don't worry.

58
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:31,070
I have no interest in you.

59
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,360
Pay by card.

60
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,800
The dress suits you well.

61
00:05:49,380 --> 00:05:50,380
It's yours.

62
00:06:02,310 --> 00:06:03,240
Who is she?

63
00:06:04,590 --> 00:06:06,650
The daughter of the State Councilor.

64
00:06:06,670 --> 00:06:09,600
Now she's a senior envoy
at the Presidential Office.

65
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,330
She was the one who saved me
at the abandoned factory before.

66
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,310
It seems that

67
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:16,870
she is coming for me.

68
00:06:18,770 --> 00:06:21,330
But you can only be mine.

69
00:06:44,030 --> 00:06:45,740
On such an important day,

70
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,560
you're still replying to emails here.

71
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,430
Can't you leave them until tomorrow?

72
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:53,000
This cross-border email today

73
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,520
must be sent out tonight.

74
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:05,200
Then at least
take a five-minute break first.

75
00:07:32,670 --> 00:07:33,790
Cedarwood?

76
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:41,270
Isn't it

77
00:07:41,659 --> 00:07:43,210
the custom scent

78
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:45,370
you picked to set the mood

79
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:49,430
for your distinguished guests?

80
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,630
Cloudsea's service motto

81
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:55,680
is to make customers forget worldly cares.

82
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,310
Since you are so distracted,

83
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,310
it's our fault.

84
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,680
It seems you need some

85
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,200
personalized services.

86
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,510
You are very good at

87
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:20,070
using own advantages

88
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,270
to interrupt the key figure's work.

89
00:08:25,290 --> 00:08:26,500
Emails won't run away

90
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:30,730
but I will.

91
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:54,600
Boss, here is an encrypted document...

92
00:08:59,030 --> 00:09:01,830
An encrypted document
that needs your signature.

93
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:33,070
No problem. Tell them to be selective
about their people.

94
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:34,400
Okay,

95
00:09:34,710 --> 00:09:36,190
I'll step out now.

96
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:00,970
Jiang Yu...

97
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:02,960
You...

98
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:06,100
Are you still in the mood to read emails?

99
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:18,790
Your service tonight

100
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:23,210
is just about passable.

101
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,120
Passable?

102
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:28,280
Then let me show you

103
00:10:29,460 --> 00:10:30,770
what it means

104
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:34,030
to be blinded by lust.
